WEBVTT

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.960
C'mon!

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:10.560
Stop.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.000
It's no use.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.790
Why were we put in this situation?

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:18.620
Who were those guys?

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:22.580
They broke into our home out of nowhere.

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:26.280
I don't understand what's going on.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.490
How long are they going to keep us in here?

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:48.050
Luca, you're also a Signer?

00:00:58.280 --> 00:00:59.850
The mark didn't vanish!

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:00.910
Why?

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:07.400
They also have the mark 
of the Crimson Dragon.

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:13.270
Four Signers have now gathered here.

00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:45.380
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can't be stopped

00:01:45.470 --> 00:01:50.410
That's deeply engraved into us

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:58.980
So don't be afraid of getting hurt

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:04.870
Break through even further

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:10.430
While carrying you beliefs in your heart

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:17.560
There's always only one truth

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:21.430
So feel the voice of your heart

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:26.260
With your unwavering emotions

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:32.260
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:07.910
Fortune Cup Finals!
Lonely King Jack Atlas

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:09.150
Everyone!

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:13.380
Everyone, hurry and leave this stadium.

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:16.890
But Bro, you still have your 
battle against the King.

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:20.050
There are four Signers in this stadium.

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:24.540
It's too dangerous if Signers 
battle against each other.

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:27.440
You should know because 
you just watched my duel.

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:30.290
But Yusei, what about your friends?

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:35.440
I'll talk with Godwin.  You 
should leave here immediately.

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:40.200
If that's what Bro wants.

00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:46.160
We should leave, even though 
I'm a little disappointed.

00:03:58.120 --> 00:03:59.150
You're…

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:03.830
Sorry, but I cannot allow you to leave.

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:07.980
Then I'll force my way through!

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:11.490
You don't care what happens 
to Yusei's friends?

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:21.400
I know you care about 
friendship.  You can't do it.

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:24.860
Now hurry up and return to your seats.

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:28.320
Stop!

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:30.550
There's no trespassing beyond this point!

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:32.060
Punk!

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:41.690
Director, you should stop 
this tournament immediately.

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:45.600
Something is cursing this tournament.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:47.640
What is this "something?"

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:48.710
I don't know.

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:53.150
However, that's no longer the issue.

00:04:53.150 --> 00:04:57.580
People in the crowd were injured.  
It's too dangerous to continue.

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:00.160
I see.  You make an excellent point.

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:01.390
Then you'll do it?

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:03.780
The tournament will continue.

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:07.900
The people have been waiting 
for this tournament.

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:12.420
If we cancel the finals, that will damage the 
reputation of the Public Maintenance Department.

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:14.600
I don't care about your reputation.

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:17.180
It's you!

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:19.200
Godwin, I want to talk with you.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.650
What are you up to?

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:23.770
Stop.

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:28.180
What do you want to talk about?

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:30.600
Before that, I want you to leave.

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:31.510
What!

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:36.050
Hey, why me?  Stop!

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:38.360
I will crush you!

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:46.130
Godwin, you kidnapped my friends and 
forced me to appear in this tournament.

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:51.660
What's your real goal that made 
you resort to extreme measures?

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:54.340
I'll answer for him.

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:57.800
This is the real reason.

00:05:58.910 --> 00:06:00.670
The mark of the Crimson Dragon.

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:05.740
His goal is to gather everyone 
who have this mark to the City.

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:10.740
That's why he encouraged me to become 
the King so that he could use me.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:17.470
Jack, wasn't it your wish 
to rule as the Duel King?

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:21.500
Only if I was a King that 
the people really wanted.

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:26.160
Two years ago, I came to the 
City because you invited me.

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:30.010
However, I wasn't your real target.

00:06:30.010 --> 00:06:31.850
It was you, Yusei.

00:06:33.340 --> 00:06:38.920
He thought that if he had me, you would 
leave Satellite to come after me.

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:41.020
That's strange.

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:44.740
If I had business with him, then 
I would have invited him directly.

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:48.680
Yusei is not the type of person 
who would accept your invitation.

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:55.690
That's why you used me to create 
a reason for us leave Satellite.

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:03.990
Run away, Rally!

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:06.490
Or else, we'll hurt you!

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.110
What did you do, punk!

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:18.900
Jack!

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:27.620
Do you know who's field this is?

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:32.220
I don't want to fight you.

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:34.750
I'm the king here!

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:37.190
I'll listen to your excuses later!

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:47.590
You cowards!  Don't you 
dare come back here again!

00:07:48.140 --> 00:07:48.810
Huh?

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:03.910
What do you want?

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:07.230
I wanted to thank you.

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:10.150
All I did was protect my field.

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:17.700
Hey, I'm tuning Yusei's D-Wheel right now.

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:20.070
We're having a test run tomorrow.

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:25.730
Jack, you should come!  You 
won't believe how fast it is!

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:34.800
We were friends before!  Let's 
all duel together again!

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:37.540
Jack…

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.850
I'm different than him.

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:42.770
What happened between you and Yusei?

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:47.240
Our goals are just different.

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:52.420
All I want is for the two 
of you to be friends.

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:57.020
Because you're both Satellite's hope!

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:03.160
If you feel like it, come and watch.

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:04.680
See you!

00:09:19.380 --> 00:09:19.990
Who is it?

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:27.350
Nice to meet you, Jack Atlas.

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:33.280
My name is Jeager.

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:38.380
I bring a message from Rex Godwin, the 
director of the Public Maintenance Department.

00:09:38.730 --> 00:09:40.880
What does the Public Maintenance 
Department want with me?

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:44.070
To invite you to the City.

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:50.590
The director thinks that the 
City needs a King to rule it.

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:55.760
The King will serve as the symbol of the City, giving hope and

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:59.760
dreams to the people, which will lead to development and public order.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:04.600
He wants you to fulfill that role.

00:10:05.050 --> 00:10:09.780
Because that mark on your right 
arm is the symbol of the King!

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:18.210
Tomorrow evening at five o'clock, the 
pipeline will be shut down for an hour.

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:22.010
We're already prepared to welcome you.

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:27.030
However, as a passport into the 
City, you need to bring two things.

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:32.080
The Red Dragon Archfiend 
and Stardust Dragon cards.

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:37.480
We know that you don't have Stardust Dragon.

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:40.700
However, we require that 
you bring both cards.

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:44.100
We won't ask how you got the card.

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:49.230
Jack, it's up to you whether 
you believe me or not.

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:51.650
But think carefully.

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:53.910
This is your only chance.

00:10:53.910 --> 00:11:02.920
It's up to you whether you end your life as the 
king of the slums or rule the City as a true King.

00:11:07.650 --> 00:11:10.390
I'll be waiting in the City.

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:36.330
You want me to do a favor for you?

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:38.940
I've decided to leave here.

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:41.390
Seriously?  But how?

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:44.280
In order to do that, I need your help.

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:47.390
If I can help, I'll do anything!

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:49.250
I see.

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:55.930
Rally is late.

00:11:56.700 --> 00:12:00.630
And he's the one who wanted 
to test run the D-Wheel today.

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:04.220
He's been visiting Jack a lot recently.

00:12:05.230 --> 00:12:07.520
Unbelievable.

00:12:07.520 --> 00:12:08.370
Stop that.

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:11.450
Rally is free to choose 
who he hangs out with.

00:12:11.450 --> 00:12:13.500
That's true, but…

00:12:16.690 --> 00:12:17.510
Jack?

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:19.900
Someone kidnapped Rally.

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:21.130
What?

00:12:22.270 --> 00:12:24.250
Let's split up and look for him.

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:37.660
Yusei, I found out where Rally is.

00:12:38.030 --> 00:12:38.970
What?

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:45.960
Where's Rally?

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.310
Look over there.

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:50.500
Rally!

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:54.090
At this rate, he'll be 
swept out into the sea.

00:12:54.490 --> 00:12:56.860
If the boat capsizes in 
this storm, he's finished.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.740
Why is Rally over there?

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:03.020
I'll tell you the truth.

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:04.960
I did it.

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:08.340
If I can help, I'll do anything!

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:09.880
I see.

00:13:22.770 --> 00:13:23.600
Jack…

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:26.740
I received an invitation from the City.

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:31.470
The ticket into the City is my Red Dragon 
Archfiend and your Stardust Dragon.

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:32.080
What?

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:37.100
But you can go to the City 
if you have the two cards.

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:38.960
What will you do?

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:47.120
If we battle, you can watch the 
boat disappear among the waves.

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:49.840
Or...

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:36.940
Sorry, Yusei.  It's my fault.

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:42.390
Back then, you chose your 
friends over the cards.

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:47.520
And I took a different path than 
you.  The path of the King.

00:14:53.610 --> 00:14:56.690
But that no longer matters.

00:14:57.860 --> 00:14:59.640
Release the hostages.

00:15:01.030 --> 00:15:03.420
Yusei won't try to escape now.

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:06.720
He doesn't need handcuffs to battle me!

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:11.710
It's the least you can do 
to pay for what you've done!

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:16.760
If that's the will of the King, then fine.

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:24.770
No way!  It opened!

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:25.800
Seriously?

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:32.770
This is where we were?

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:35.480
Everybody listen!

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:36.440
Look.

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:38.220
The special match will now begin!

00:15:38.690 --> 00:15:42.180
There were unexpected accidents, 
but the Fortune Cup continues!

00:15:43.910 --> 00:15:45.630
Jack versus Yusei?

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:46.960
What's going on?

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:49.090
Look at Yusei!

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:50.390
That's a marker!

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:53.320
What happened to him?

00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:57.990
Yusei…

00:15:57.990 --> 00:16:00.760
He really is going to battle Jack.

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:04.160
Everyone…

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:05.760
Yusei.

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:08.710
No one will interfere now.

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:10.700
Jack.

00:16:11.980 --> 00:16:17.610
This may be pointless to say, but I 
believe that you are the true King.

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:20.300
Everyone knows that.

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:30.270
Show me the power of the 
legendary Crimson Dragon.

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:43.240
Yusei, in this duel, we will 
determine who is the true King!

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:48.480
However, if the Crimson Dragon appears 
again, then we won't escape unharmed!

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:50.390
So you're scared?

00:16:50.390 --> 00:16:54.220
If that happens, I'll make the 
Crimson Dragon's power mine!

00:16:57.010 --> 00:17:02.700
Come to think of it, Yanagi said that there 
are five marks of the Crimson Dragon.

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:04.370
Can it be?

00:17:06.530 --> 00:17:09.800
There's one more person here somewhere?

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:15.170
Field Spell Speed World, set on!

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:18.750
Duel mode on.  Autopilot standby.

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:23.430
Speed World now controls the field!

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:26.540
The only spells that can be 
activated are Speed Spells!

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:30.930
Riding Duel!  Acceleration!

00:17:36.170 --> 00:17:38.670
As the challenger, you get to go first!

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:40.790
My turn!

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:44.220
I summon Shield Wing in defense position!

00:17:48.180 --> 00:17:50.710
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:52.940
My turn!

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:56.930
I summon Twin-Sword Marauder!

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:04.190
Twin-Sword Marauder attacks Shield Wing!

00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:07.020
When Twin-Sword Marauder's attack points are greater than your

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:11.020
monster's defense points, the difference is dealt to you as damage!

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:19.820
I knew that you would summon 
a monster in defense position.

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:23.750
In a duel, a King always thinks 
one step ahead of his opponent.

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:28.750
However, Shield Wing cannot be destroyed 
until the second attack during a single turn.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.100
You fool!

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:34.760
When Twin-Sword Marauder attacks a monster 
in defense position, it can attack again!

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:35.610
What?

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:39.380
Even among kings, this King 
thinks two steps ahead.

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:42.280
Go!  Double Assault!

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:48.340
I set one card and end my turn!

00:18:49.110 --> 00:18:50.310
Yusei...

00:18:50.570 --> 00:18:55.280
I have a card in my hand that's 
especially suited for this occasion.

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:59.030
In this duel, I will show 
you the pride of a King!

00:19:02.430 --> 00:19:03.550
My turn!

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:07.030
Meteor Stream…

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:10.990
What are my cards trying to tell me?

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:14.230
I summon Junk Synchron from my hand.

00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:20.190
Junk Synchron tunes Shield Wing.

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:31.700
The stars come together to call forth a new 
power!  Become the path that lights the way!

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:33.880
Synchro Summon!

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:37.120
Come forth, Junk Warrior!

00:19:43.630 --> 00:19:45.180
Scrap Fist!

00:19:49.990 --> 00:19:53.630
Then the Continuous Trap Synchro Blast!

00:19:55.380 --> 00:20:00.750
With this card, when a Synchro Monster 
attacks, you take 500 points of damage!

00:20:01.790 --> 00:20:03.570
You're finally getting serious.

00:20:04.240 --> 00:20:05.750
My turn!

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:10.590
I summon Dark Tinker from my hand!

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:16.540
Then I activate my trap Powerful Rebirth!

00:20:17.310 --> 00:20:19.950
This card lets me Special Summon a Level 4-or-below

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:22.950
monster from my graveyard, and then it becomes an Equip Card!

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:27.760
All right!  Dark Tinker is Level 3 
and Twin-Sword Marauder is Level 4.

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:32.250
Therefore, he won't be able to summon Red 
Dragon Archfiend because it's Level 8.

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:33.900
Put the pressure on him, Yusei!

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:42.520
The monster resurrected using Powerful Rebirth 
gains 100 attack and defense points and one Level.

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:43.230
What?

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:44.160
No way!

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:47.170
You idiots, carve this into your soul!

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:51.180
The King of Kings duels three steps ahead!

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:54.880
Dark Tinker tunes Twin-Sword Marauder!

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:58.550
The pulse of the King now forms a line here!

00:20:58.550 --> 00:21:01.120
Witness the power of the rumbling heavens!

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:02.830
Synchro Summon!

00:21:03.140 --> 00:21:06.920
My soul!  Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:21:09.050 --> 00:21:10.800
Red Dragon Archfiend.

00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:17.730
In order to walk the path of the King, I threw away

00:21:17.730 --> 00:21:21.730
everything so that I could climb out from the bottom of the world.

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:25.030
I threw away my hometown and my friends.

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:27.250
This mark guided me.

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:30.900
And now, you're trying to walk the same path

00:21:30.900 --> 00:21:33.900
even though you didn't have to throw away anything!

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:36.720
I can't allow that, Yusei!

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:40.250
I refuse to lose to you!

00:22:04.320 --> 00:22:09.900
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:15.290
We'll step forward and find out

00:22:15.660 --> 00:22:21.210
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:21.370 --> 00:22:26.450
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:26.640 --> 00:22:29.610
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:32.180 --> 00:22:35.200
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:37.150 --> 00:22:42.360
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:42.490 --> 00:22:47.760
And I'll someday pass them to you

00:22:48.190 --> 00:22:53.700
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:59.040
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:59.570 --> 00:23:05.100
I'll dash and acquire all the bright futures

00:23:05.240 --> 00:23:14.510
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
